      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Loads all Battle.net front-end UI CEL images into global pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. For each UI image, format the path using FormatDataPath (FUN_6fa12b5e) with DATA_GLOBAL directory\n2. Call LoadCelImage to load the sprite from the formatted path\n3. Store the returned CelImage pointer in the corresponding global variable\n4. Process 49 total UI images covering popups, buttons, backgrounds, cursors, scrollbars,\n   chat elements, game lobby UI, character class tabs, and overlay effects\n5. Call SetCelGlobals with the squelch and select aura images for player selection highlighting\n\nParameters: None\n\nReturns: void\n\nGlobal Variables Set (49 total):\n  - g_pCelPopUpLargest (0x6fa2174c): Large popup background\n  - g_pCelMediumButtonBlank (0x6fa21750): Medium button template\n  - g_pCelBnetBackground (0x6fa21748): Battle.net main background\n  - g_pCelCursorOpenHand (0x6fa21754): Open hand cursor\n  - g_pCelCursorRotate (0x6fa21758): Rotating cursor\n  - g_pCelScrollbar (0x6fa2175c): General scrollbar\n  - g_pCelJoinGameScrollbar (0x6fa21760): Join game list scrollbar\n  - g_pCelChatLeftButtons (0x6fa21768): Chat left buttons\n  - g_pCelChatLeftButtons1 (0x6fa2176c): Chat left buttons variant 1\n  - g_pCelChatLeftButtons2 (0x6fa21770): Chat left buttons variant 2\n  - g_pCelChatRightButtons (0x6fa21774): Chat right buttons\n  - g_pCelChatRightTopButton (0x6fa21778): Chat right top button\n  - g_pCelChatArrows (0x6fa2177c): Chat navigation arrows\n  - g_pCelJoinGameBackground (0x6fa2178c): Join game background\n  - g_pCelGameButtonBlank (0x6fa21798): Game button template\n  - g_pCelJoinGameClickBox (0x6fa2179c): Join game selection box\n  - g_pCelNumberArrows1-4 (0x6fa217fc-0x6fa21808): Number spinner arrows\n  - g_pCelNumberGreyArrows (0x6fa2180c): Disabled number arrows\n  - g_pCelGreyLevelBox (0x6fa217a0): Grey level selection box\n  - g_pCelCreateJoinBackground (0x6fa21810): Create/join background\n  - g_pCelOkayButton (0x6fa21814): OK button\n  - g_pCelCreateGameBackground (0x6fa21848): Create game background\n  - g_pCelCreateGameButton (0x6fa2184c): Create game button\n  - g_pCelWideButtonBlank (0x6fa21854): Wide button template\n  - g_pCelCancelButtonBlank (0x6fa21868): Cancel button template\n  - g_pCelYesNoButtonBlank (0x6fa2186c): Yes/No button template\n  - g_pCelD2LogoBlackBnet (0x6fa21884): D2 logo (black background)\n  - g_pCelD2LogoBnet (0x6fa21888): D2 logo (normal)\n  - g_pCelBlankBackground2 (0x6fa21790): Blank background variant 2\n  - g_pCelGemButton (0x6fa21794): Gem button\n  - g_pCelLadderChoiceExp (0x6fa21870): Ladder expansion choice\n  - g_pCelHardcoreLadderBackground (0x6fa21874): Hardcore ladder background\n  - g_pCelEditProfileBackground (0x6fa2187c): Edit profile background\n  - g_pCelPlayerProfileBackground (0x6fa21878): Player profile background\n  - g_pCelHelpBackground (0x6fa21880): Help screen background\n  - g_pCelRadioButton (0x6fa217a4): Radio button\n  - g_pCelRadioButtonGrey (0x6fa217a8): Disabled radio button\n  - g_pCelPopUpOk (0x6fa217ac): Popup OK button\n  - g_pCelCancelButton (0x6fa217b0): Cancel button\n  - g_pCelOverallTab (0x6fa217b4): Overall statistics tab\n  - g_pCelAmazonTab (0x6fa217b8): Amazon class tab\n  - g_pCelSorceressTab (0x6fa217bc): Sorceress class tab\n  - g_pCelNecromancerTab (0x6fa217c0): Necromancer class tab\n  - g_pCelPaladinTab (0x6fa217c4): Paladin class tab\n  - g_pCelBarbarianTab (0x6fa217c8): Barbarian class tab\n  - g_pCelDruidTab (0x6fa217cc): Druid class tab (expansion)\n  - g_pCelAssassinTab (0x6fa217d0): Assassin class tab (expansion)\n  - g_pCelSquelchAura (0x6fa217f4): Squelch player overlay\n  - g_pCelSelectAura (0x6fa217f8): Selected player overlay\n\nCalled from: D2Multi initialization (FUN_6fa04270)\nClassification: Initialization function",
