      "name": "LaunchUrlInDefaultBrowser",
      "signature": "uint LaunchUrlInDefaultBrowser(DWORD param_1, undefined4 param_2, undefined4 param_3, HANDLE param_4, HANDLE param_5, undefined4 param_6, undefined4 param_7, DWORD param_8)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "LaunchUrlInDefaultBrowser - Opens a URL in the system's default web browser\n\nFUNCTION CLASSIFICATION: Worker Function\n\nALGORITHM:\n1. Call FUN_6fa12ce0 to initialize/get URL string\n2. Query callback at DAT_6fa20a1c+0xb0 to get URL pointer\n3. If URL is null, return 1 (failure)\n4. Zero-initialize 0x7FE byte buffer for registry key path\n5. Get desktop window and set foreground\n6. Format registry key path: HKCR\\%s\\.html using FUN_6fa12b5e\n7. Open registry key HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT with KEY_READ access\n8. Query default value to get file type association\n9. Close registry key\n10. Format shell command path: HKCR\\%s\\%s\\shell\\open\\command\n11. Zero-initialize command buffer  \n12. Open shell\\open\\command registry key\n13. Query command line template from registry\n14. Close registry key\n15. Append \" %1\" to command (length calculation with strlen loops)\n16. Append URL to command line\n17. Initialize STARTUPINFO structure (0x44 bytes)\n18. Call CreateProcessA with NORMAL_PRIORITY_CLASS (0x20)\n19. On success: close process/thread handles, return 1\n20. On failure: show error UI with ValidateStringId(0x14dc)\n21. Dispatch inventory item handlers for cleanup\n22. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0\n23. Create UI button via CreateObjectByTypeFactory\n24. Create additional UI elements (text box, etc.)\n25. Set callback to FUN_6fa06a10\n26. Call cleanup callback at DAT_6fa20a1c+0x78\n27. Return 1\n\nPARAMETERS: None (void)\n\nRETURNS:\n  uint - Always returns 1\n\nGLOBALS ACCESSED:\n  DAT_6fa20a1c - vtable/callback table pointer\n  DAT_6fa218f8 - initialization byte\n  g_nNumSubChildren - count of child UI elements\n  g_apSubChildrenArray - array of child element pointers\n  g_dwCurrentInputItem - current input focus item\n  g_dwInventorySubState - inventory UI state\n  g_UITypeInventoryButton - button factory type\n  g_UITypeInventoryTextBox - text box factory type\n  _g_pfnSubPanelCallback - sub-panel callback function pointer\n\nREGISTRY KEYS:\n  HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\.html - gets default file type\n  HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\\<filetype>\\shell\\open\\command - gets browser command\n\nSPECIAL CASES:\n  - Function boundaries appear broken in Ghidra (single instruction body)\n  - Decompiler infers parameters from stack usage patterns\n  - Falls back to error UI if registry query or process launch fails\n  - Creates up to 32 (0x1F + 1) child UI elements with assert check\n\nERROR HANDLING:\n  - Registry open/query failures fall through to error UI path\n  - CreateProcessA failure triggers ValidateStringId error display\n  - FogAssert called if g_nNumSubChildren >= 32",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.08",
