      "name": "InitializeGameJoinSession",
      "signature": "int InitializeGameJoinSession(short nSessionPort, char * lpszGameName, char * lpszPassword, char * param_4)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "InitializeGameJoinSession - Initializes game session state for joining a game\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set inventory panel mode to 2 (join game mode)\n2. Call initialization functions FUN_6fa10090 and FUN_6fa0f490\n3. Dispatch inventory item handlers for all 10 inventory slots\n4. Set current input item and pointer state\n5. Loop through and dispatch handlers for sub-children array\n6. Reset sub-children count and inventory sub-state to 0\n7. Call FUN_6fa117b0 and reset extra state\n8. Dispatch handlers for slots 9 and 10\n9. If special mode flag == 1, call FUN_6fa127f0\n10. If panel mode == 3, reset to 0\n11. If inventory panel state exists, set bit mask\n12. Set callback to ActivateInventoryPanelStateCallback\n13. Store session port at g_pGameListData+0x18\n14. Copy game name string to g_pGameListData+0x1a (optimized memcpy)\n15. Copy password string to g_pGameListData+0x23d (optimized memcpy)\n16. Branch based on network flag at offset 0x225:\n    - Network SET: Check Ordinal_10002, send join request via Ordinal_10005\n    - Network CLEAR: Set local join type, call SetGameState and StopMessageLoop\n\nParameters:\n  nSessionPort (ECX, short) - Session port number stored in game list data\n  lpszGameName (EDX, char *) - Null-terminated game name string\n  lpszPassword (Stack+4, char *) - Null-terminated password string\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Success: Session join initiated or local game setup started\n  0 - Failure: Network unavailable, error 0x1413 displayed\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Network unavailable shows string ID 0x1413 error\n  - Session request ID wraps around zero\n  - Local game copies additional string to offset 0x32\n\nExternal Calls:\n  Ordinal_10002 - D2Client.CheckBattleNetAvailable\n  Ordinal_10005 - D2Client.SendSessionJoinRequest",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.08",
      "method": "CAL",
