      "comment": "Toggles player enter/leave notifications when input matches player name.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate strlen(lpszPlayerName) and strlen(lpszInputName)\n2. If strlen(lpszPlayerName) > strlen(lpszInputName), return 0 (no match)\n3. Case-insensitive compare first strlen(lpszPlayerName) chars using ToUpperChar\n4. If any char differs, return 0 (no match)\n5. Check character after matched portion is space (0x20) or null (0x00)\n6. If not delimiter, return 0 (partial match rejected)\n7. Repeat case-insensitive comparison for full validation\n8. If second comparison fails, return 1 (toggle but mismatch)\n9. Toggle g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled (XOR with 1)\n10. Initialize Unicode buffer local_200[512] via default_constructor_closure\n11. Select message string based on new notification state:\n    - If enabled: szNotificationsEnabled (\"Player entering/leaving notifications are enabled.\")\n    - If disabled: szNotificationsDisabled (\"Player entering/leaving notifications are disabled.\")\n12. Copy selected string to acStack_300 buffer using REP MOVSD/MOVSB\n13. Convert ANSI string to Unicode via toUnicode(local_200, acStack_300, 0x200)\n14. If g_pCharSelectControl is valid, call TextBoxAddText to display message\n15. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n  lpszInputName (ECX): Pointer to user input string (command argument)\n  lpszPlayerName (EDX): Pointer to player name to match against\n\nReturns:\n  1 - Name matched and notifications toggled, or partial match with delimiter\n  0 - No match (name too short, char mismatch, or invalid delimiter)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Empty lpszPlayerName returns 0\n  - Match requires space or null after matched portion (word boundary)\n  - Function toggles state only on complete word match\n\nGlobals:\n  g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled (0x6fa21890): Notification toggle state (0=disabled, 1=enabled)\n  g_pCharSelectControl (0x6fa218c8): Pointer to character select text box control\n  szNotificationsEnabled (0x6fa1d688): \"Player entering/leaving notifications are enabled.\"\n  szNotificationsDisabled (0x6fa1d654): \"Player entering/leaving notifications are disabled.\"",
