      "name": "ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage",
      "signature": "int ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage(char * lpszInput, int nWhisperMode)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Processes chat input commands and dispatches UI message handling.\n\nCLASSIFICATION: Worker function - processes user chat input and handles slash commands\n\nALGORITHM:\n1. Determine input mode based on nWhisperMode, first char, and chat history state\n2. If whisper mode enabled AND input doesn't start with '/' AND chat history exists:\n   a. Extract last whisper target from g_pChatHistoryBuffer+4\n   b. Format command as \"/whisper *%s %s\" into g_szCommandBuffer\n3. Otherwise copy input directly to g_szCommandBuffer via inline strlen+memcpy\n4. If command starts with '/':\n   a. Backup autocomplete entries (copy 0x900 bytes)\n   b. Copy command to autocomplete entries array\n   c. Increment g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount (max 10)\n   d. Check for \"/r\" (short reply) command via HandleReplyWhisperCommand\n   e. Check for \"/reply\" command via HandleReplyWhisperCommand\n   f. Check for \"/d2notify\" command:\n      - Toggle g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled flag\n      - Initialize Unicode buffer (256 wchar_t)\n      - Copy status message (\"enabled\"/\"disabled\")\n      - Convert to Unicode and display via CharSelectTextBoxAddText\n   g. If not d2notify, check callback vtable[0x74] for online status:\n      - If offline: ValidateStringId(0x14e7), show sub-panel via FUN_6fa06730\n      - If online: call vtable[0x14] to dispatch command\n5. If command doesn't start with '/' (regular chat message):\n   a. Check callback vtable[0x74] for online status\n   b. If offline: ValidateStringId(0x14e7), create message panel:\n      - Dispatch existing sub-children handlers\n      - Reset g_nNumSubChildren and g_dwInventorySubState\n      - Create InventoryButton, SecondaryButton, InventoryTextBox UI elements\n      - Assert max children limit (32 elements)\n      - Add text to textbox and set callback\n   c. If online: dispatch via vtable[0x14], then call FUN_6fa0cb60\n6. Clear input edit box via EditData_SetString\n7. Calculate text box scroll position and navigate if needed\n8. Return 1 (success)\n\nPARAMETERS:\n  lpszInput (ECX) - Input string from chat box (ANSI)\n  nWhisperMode (EDX) - Non-zero if whisper mode active (determines command prefix)\n\nRETURNS:\n  Always returns 1 (success)\n\nSPECIAL CASES:\n  - Empty/null strings handled by string copy loop\n  - Autocomplete entries capped at 10 maximum\n  - Max 32 sub-children allowed (assert triggers on overflow)\n  - Unreachable block at 0x6fa06612 removed by decompiler\n\nGLOBALS ACCESSED:\n  g_pChatHistoryBuffer (0x6fa21aa4) - Chat history ring buffer pointer\n  g_szCommandBuffer (0x6fa214a8) - Current command string buffer\n  g_dwAutocompleteEntryCount (0x6fa2188c) - Number of autocomplete entries\n  g_aszAutocompleteEntries (0x6fa20aa4) - Autocomplete command history\n  g_aszAutocompleteBackup (0x6fa20ba4) - Backup of autocomplete entries\n  g_fPlayerNotificationsEnabled (0x6fa21890) - Player enter/leave notification flag\n  g_pCallbackVtable (0x6fa20a1c) - UI callback vtable pointer\n  g_nNumSubChildren (0x6fa21734) - Number of sub-panel child elements\n  g_apSubChildrenArray (0x6fa20a20) - Array of sub-panel child pointers\n  g_dwCurrentInputItem (0x6fa216d0) - Current input item identifier\n  g_dwInventorySubState (0x6fa2173c) - Inventory sub-panel state\n  g_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current input edit box pointer\n  g_pCharSelectControl (0x6fa218c8) - Character select control pointer\n  _g_pfnSubPanelCallback (0x6fa218e0) - Sub-panel callback function pointer\n\nMAGIC NUMBERS:\n  0x14e7 - String ID for offline message\n  0x900 - Size of autocomplete backup buffer (2304 bytes = 9 entries * 256 bytes)\n  0x200 - Unicode buffer size (512 bytes)\n  0x100 - Loop count for Unicode initialization (256 wchar_t)\n  0x1f/0x20 - Max sub-children limit (31 check, 32 max)\n  0x1086 - Source file line number for assert\n  0x74 - Vtable offset for online status check\n  0x14 - Vtable offset for command dispatch",
