      "name": "InitializePanelDisplayDefault",
      "signature": "void InitializePanelDisplayDefault(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes panel display to default state, resetting slots and creating UI elements.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Clear 9 panel state slots (g_dwPanelResetFlag through g_dwPanelStateSlot8) to 0\n2. Clear g_dwInventoryExtraState to 0\n3. Set g_szCommandBufferEnd to 1000 (0x3E8)\n4. Check if game list data byte at offset 0x225 is non-zero\n5. If set, call Ordinal_10002 to check special game mode condition\n6. If Ordinal_10002 returns 0 (special path):\n   a. Validate string ID 0x1413\n   b. Call FUN_6fa10090 and FUN_6fa0f490 for pre-reset cleanup\n   c. Dispatch inventory item handlers for slots 1-8\n   d. Set current input item and pointer from global state\n   e. Loop through sub-children array dispatching handlers\n   f. Reset g_nNumSubChildren to 0, call SetCurrentInputItem again\n   g. Clear g_dwInventorySubState to 0, call FUN_6fa117b0\n   h. Clear g_dwInventoryExtraState, dispatch slots 9-10\n   i. If g_dwSpecialModeFlag == 1, call FUN_6fa127f0\n   j. If g_dwInventoryPanelMode == 3, reset to 0\n   k. If g_pInventoryPanelState non-null, toggle bit mask (set 1, then clear 0)\n   l. Reset button frames 1, 3, 2, 1 to 0\n   m. Create text box via factory, add text with defaults\n   n. Clear _g_pfnSubPanelCallback, return\n7. Otherwise (normal path):\n   a. Assert g_nNumSubChildren < 32 (0x20) or trigger FogAssert\n   b. Create first object via factory (g_TextBoxObjectType1), add to sub-children\n   c. Increment g_nNumSubChildren, re-check limit\n   d. Create second object via factory (g_TextBoxObjectType2), add to sub-children\n   e. Validate string ID 0x14C5, add text to created object\n   f. Call FUN_6fa07aa0 for additional setup\n   g. Set g_nPanelScrollOffset to -2 (0xFFFFFFFE)\n   h. Set g_byPanelDisplayMode to 0x23\n   i. Set g_dwPanelStateDecrement to 0x10\n   j. Set _g_dwPanelTimerValue to 1000\n   k. Call Ordinal_10012 to finalize panel setup\n\nParameters:\n  None (uses global state)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSSA Temporaries (compiler-generated, cannot be renamed):\n  iVar1: int - Ordinal_10002 result, also loop counter for sub-children\n  piVar2: int * - pointer to created object from CreateObjectByTypeFactory\n  pdwInventoryType: uint * - pointer iterating through sub-children array\n  wszText, wszText_00: wchar_t * - text strings from ValidateStringId\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If g_nNumSubChildren exceeds 31 (0x1F), triggers FogAssert at line 0x1086\n- Special mode flag at 0x6fa3e9cc == 1 triggers FUN_6fa127f0\n- Panel mode 3 is special case that gets reset to 0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x1413: String ID for special mode text\n- 0x14C5: String ID for normal mode text\n- 0x1086: Assert line number for max children check\n- 0x20 (32): Maximum allowed sub-children count\n- 0x3E8 (1000): Command buffer end value / timer value\n- 0xFFFFFFFE (-2): Panel scroll offset reset value\n- 0x23: Panel display mode value\n- 0x10: Panel state decrement value\n\nOrdinal Calls:\n- Ordinal_10002: Checks special game mode condition (returns 0 for special path)\n- Ordinal_10012: Finalizes panel setup and applies display settings",
