      "name": "SubmitChatEditBoxInputWhisperMode",
      "signature": "int SubmitChatEditBoxInputWhisperMode(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Submits current chat input with whisper mode enabled.\n\nCLASSIFICATION: Callback/Handler - UI callback invoked when submitting chat in whisper mode\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load g_pCurrentInputPointer and get Unicode text via D2Win_GetEditBoxChild\n2. If edit box child is NULL, return success (1)\n3. Get length of Unicode text via Unicode::strlen\n4. If text is empty (length 0), return success (1)\n5. Convert Unicode text to ANSI via Unicode::unicode2Win into 256-byte stack buffer\n6. Call ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage(szAnsiBuffer, 1) with whisper mode enabled\n7. Return result from ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage\n\nParameters:\nNone (parameterless callback)\n\nReturns:\nint - Always 1 on empty/null input; otherwise result from ProcessChatCommandAndUIMessage\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Empty input text silently returns 1 (success)\n- NULL edit box child returns 1 (success)\n- Conversion uses fixed 256-byte buffer (max input length limitation)\n- Whisper mode (nWhisperMode=1) prefixes input with \"/whisper *target \" if chat history exists\n\nGlobals Accessed:\ng_pCurrentInputPointer (0x6fa218d0) - Current input edit box control pointer\n\nCross-References:\n- Referenced from g_pfnSubmitChatWhisperMode at 0x6fa1b1a0\n- Called by UI system as whisper-mode submit callback\n\nLocal Variables:\npUnicodeText (pUVar1) - Unicode * - Unicode text pointer from edit box\nnTextLength (iVar2) - int - Length of unicode text / return value\nszAnsiBuffer (acStack_100) - char[256] - ANSI conversion buffer on stack\n\nRelated Functions:\nSubmitChatEditBoxInput (0x6fa0af00) - Same function but with nWhisperMode=0",
