      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Initializes default values for the Battle.net game list UI panel.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set game list panel button frame to 0 (inactive state)\n2. Set scroll up button frame to 1 (active state)\n3. Set scroll down button frame to 0 (inactive state)\n4. Set difficulty level to 1 (Normal difficulty)\n5. Set game list data flag at offset 0x20B to 1 (enable filtering)\n6. Return 1 (success)\n\nParameters:\n- None (void function)\n\nReturns:\n- 1: Always returns success\n\nGlobals Modified:\n- g_pBnetGameListPanel: Panel button frame set to 0\n- g_pBnetGameListScrollUp: Scroll up button frame set to 1\n- g_pBnetGameListScrollDown: Scroll down button frame set to 0\n- g_nDifficultyLevel: Set to 1 (Normal)\n- g_pGameListData+0x20B: Filter flag set to 1\n\nClassification: Initialization function for Battle.net game list UI defaults",
